WEBVTT

00:25:58.383 --> 00:26:00.439
We started out as a country, in the US,

00:26:00.463 --> 00:26:03.682
believing that God
was the real magnetic idea,

00:26:03.706 --> 00:26:07.593
that America was where God's plan
for creation would be realized.

00:26:07.617 --> 00:26:11.241
And then, in the 19th century, nation,
American exceptionalism and all that,

00:26:11.265 --> 00:26:12.420
Manifest Destiny --

00:26:12.444 --> 00:26:13.723
this was the holy mission.

00:26:13.747 --> 00:26:17.293
Recently, it's been self,
the liberation of the self.

00:26:17.317 --> 00:26:19.659
And, as I say, we've sort of
run out the string,

00:26:19.683 --> 00:26:23.227
and now we've got a bunch of paradigms
that are competing with each other.

00:26:23.251 --> 00:26:25.406
I would say on the left,
it's social justice,

00:26:25.430 --> 00:26:27.821
the idea that we can defeat
systems of oppression,

00:26:27.845 --> 00:26:29.802
and that's a real magnetic idea.

00:26:29.826 --> 00:26:33.006
On the right, it's the tribe,
ethnic nationalism.